<title>UK: Algeria Nov crude price up 10 cts at Brent +80 cts.</title>
<headline>Algeria Nov crude price up 10 cts at Brent +80 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian state oil company Sonatrach has settled negotiations with some contract holders for November Saharan blend crude exports at a higher Dated Brent plus 80 cents a barrel, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>November Saharan blend will be priced 10 cents higher than October's Brent plus 70 cents.</p>
<p>Traders said other contract holders were expected to follow suit.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
